# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Khan Academy Timer — ignored files
#
# Rule of thumb: anything that can be regenerated from the tracked sources by a
# documented command is ignored. Everything needed to build, test, install and
# audit the extension is tracked.
#
# No trailing slashes: a trailing slash would make a pattern match directories
# only, which silently fails for a stray same-named file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Dependencies and package-manager caches -------------------------------
node_modules
.pnpm-store
.npm-cache
.yarn

# --- Build output ----------------------------------------------------------
# `pnpm run build` regenerates this from public/ + src/ via scripts/build.mjs.
# Ignoring it does NOT remove it from the working tree: `dist` stays on disk
# and Edge can still load it with "Load unpacked" (edge://extensions).
# A fresh clone just runs `pnpm install && pnpm run build` first — see README.
dist

# --- TypeScript incremental build info ------------------------------------
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Scratch output from the research / verification tooling ---------------
# capture-dom.sh writes into references/.tmp-caps; the CDP tools create
# throwaway browser profiles named .cdp-profile-<pid>.
references/.tmp-caps
references/.tmp-*
.cdp-profile-*

# --- Logs and editor / OS noise -------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.idea
.vscode

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately TRACKED — do not add these to the ignore list above:
#
#   references/       research evidence: sanitised DOM snapshots, screenshots
#                     and the reproducibility tooling. These are deliverables
#                     (spec 10.7) and cannot be regenerated without hitting the
#                     live site, so they must be versioned.
#   public/icons/     generated by `pnpm run icons`, but the PNGs are referenced
#                     by the extension manifest
#   pnpm-lock.yaml    pins the exact dependency graph for `pnpm install`
#   khan-academy-timer-project-spec.md
#                     the requirements of record
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
